# row of this file): Try-Tiny context.t 25 -> 13 and finally.t 29 -> 11 (the
# same s499j cause: the finally rows never run), Role-Tiny load-module.t
# 1 -> 0 (row 1 passes, but SBCL's "While evaluating the form" note -- #1970 --
# has no trailing newline and run-dist-t.pl merges stderr into the TAP, so
